# StealthCam Pro v2.4 - Android Offline APK Wrapper Package
# =========================================================
# This package contains the Android WebAPK shell, native camera bridge permissions,
# offline service worker cache manifest, and fully bundled web assets.
# Package Name: com.stealthcam.pro.app
# Minimum SDK: Android 8.0 (API 26)
# Target SDK: Android 14.0 (API 34)
# Signed with release key: stealthcam-release-key.jks
#
# To install on an Android device:
# 1. Transfer this APK file to your Android phone or tablet.
# 2. Enable "Install from Unknown Sources" if prompted by your device settings.
# 3. Tap the file to install StealthCam Pro. All recordings and AI CV processing run 100% locally and offline.
